<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Experimental Setup</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Models</h3>

<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Open-source models.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Locally-hosted models are served with vLLM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib2" title="" class="ltx_ref">20</a></cite> using a
single-pass generation pipeline.
The context window is set to 4,096 tokens, GPU memory utilisation to 90%,
and tensor parallelism is configurable via <span id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">--tensor-parallel-size</span>.
Unless a model-family override is specified, all open-source models are
generated with a maximum of 512 output tokens, temperature <math id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau=1.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau=1.0</annotation></semantics></math>,
and <math id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{top-}p=1.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>top-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{top-}p=1.0</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
