</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="A5.F25.2" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><span id="A5.F25.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(a) Perceived-need prompt v1</span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_4">
