<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span><span id="A5.F27.sf2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Tool-calling behavior without hard stop.</span></figcaption>
