<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 28: </span>[InvivoQuery Task] The NDCG rank correlation under different budgets across different models. The correlation is low, which reflects that the models are not choosing the best utility gain tool calling. Cost prompt v1.</figcaption>
</figure>
